WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.310
In John's Gospel, Thomas asks
Jesus: how can we know the way?

2
00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:10.030
Jesus answers: I am the way,
the truth, and the life.

3
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.530
No one comes to the
Father, except through me.

4
00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:18.540
Later, Peter tells the Jewish council there
is no other name under heaven by which

5
00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:20.250
we must be saved.

6
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.870
But what about people of
other faiths, or none,

7
00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:25.460
who never truly hear of Jesus?

8
00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:28.300
So does that shut everyone else out?

9
00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:32.690
In this mission, you'll also read what
Peter says when God sends him to a Roman

10
00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:33.860
officer.

11
00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:37.180
Then you'll meet a phrase that
sounds like a contradiction:

12
00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:39.300
the anonymous Christian.

13
00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:43.960
Your mission: weigh up whether
Jesus' words shut everyone else out.
